  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Verdure — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level, you have refined your technique to the absolute and learned to expand your domain. <br />\n At initiative 20, creatures within your domain fall under the effect of <em>Flower Field</em> and take 2d4 Necrotic damage. You gain half of the damage as temporary Cursed Energy that disappears once your domain ends.</p>",
